        },
        "subject": "LU-19781 lnet: Improve load/unload lustre module time",
        "message": "LU-19781 lnet: Improve load/unload lustre module time\n\nIf we have large number of LNET configured, it takes a long time\nto load and unload the module.\nWe can parallelize the shutdown sequence by splitting it into two\nparts. This way all the NI can shutdown in parallel instead of\nserially.\n\n$lnetctl net show | grep type | grep -v lo | wc -l\n126\n\n$ time lustre_rmmod\n\nreal\t2m13.673s\nuser\t0m0.416s\nsys\t0m0.150s\n\nAfter this change:\n$ time lustre_rmmod\n\nreal\t0m1.781s\nuser\t0m0.217s\nsys\t0m0.062s\n\nTest-Parameters: trivial\nSigned-off-by: Manish Regmi <mregmi@ddn.com>\nChange-Id: I2c110eb0b99aa3b564ceff47bd69bb1e82cab729\n"
      },
      "branch": "refs/heads/master"
    }
  },
